{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrath of the gods knows no bounds. Ancient Hellas is ravaged by disasters: storms, earthquakes, famine. You will lead a team on a journey through the mythical lands of Ancient Greece! Uncover who is behind the cataclysms \u2014 and why. Find every angry god, listen, understand, and bring peace. You will fight, make tough choices, and build bridges between worlds. This is a game about unity, redemption, and hope. Heal the ancient land. Hear the voices of Olympus. Weather the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:<br>\u2013 A gathering of legendary gods like never before!<br>\u2013 A new light rises \u2014 Apollo joins the fight!<br>\u2013 An epic story of Jason\u2019s battles with the Olympians!<br>\u2013 Enchanting music that echoes ancient Greece!<br>\u2013 Unique and varied gameplay mechanics in every location!<br>\u2013 Dynamic comic-style cutscenes full of action!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009120?t=1757473040","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009120?t=1757473040","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009120/df66fbec8933e79f67661c95e38b5059d09fdf3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757473040","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009120/df66fbec8933e79f67661c95e38b5059d09fdf3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757473040","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wrath of the gods knows no bounds. Ancient Hellas is ravaged by disasters: storms, earthquakes, famine. You will lead a team on a journey through the mythical lands of Ancient Greece! Uncover who is behind the cataclysms \u2014 and why. Find every angry god, listen, understand, and bring peace. You will figh